 ### Oct 26
 
+## October 22
+
+- Z.ai GLM 5.3 Flash (`zai-glm-5-3-flash`) is now available. MODEL RELEASED
+  - A multimodal 320B-parameter (18B active) Mixture-of-Experts model from Z.ai with a 1M-token context window.
+  - Built for developer agent workflows, visual coding, and complex tool-use tasks.
+  - Pricing: $0.15/M input tokens, $0.03/M cached input, $0.50/M output tokens.
+
+## October 20
+
+- We released the Voxtral 3 audio family, our next generation of speech-to-text and text-to-speech models. All four models are in Public Preview. See the Voxtral 3 announcement and the audio models pricing. MODEL RELEASED
+  - Voxtral TTS 3 (`voxtral-mini-tts-3-0`): text-to-speech with zero-shot voice cloning, streaming, and contextual delivery. See the model card.
+  - Voxtral Mini Transcribe 3 (`voxtral-mini-transcribe-3-0`): offline transcription and diarization with timestamps. See the model card.
+  - Voxtral Mini Transcribe Realtime 3 (`voxtral-mini-transcribe-realtime-3-0`): real-time transcription. See the model card.
+  - Voxtral Small Transcribe 3 (`voxtral-small-transcribe-3-0`): offline transcription and diarization with timestamps. See the model card.
+- We released Voice Agents, a managed real-time bidirectional voice pipeline (microphone capture, STT, LLM, TTS, playback) exposed through the Voice Agents SDK, with telephony, browser, and custom-audio interfaces. See the Voice Agents overview and Voice Agents pricing. OTHER
